ft\u0131. Bedensel engelinin kendisine sa\u011flad\u0131\u011f\u0131 SGK imkanlar\u0131n\u0131 kullanarak 2011 Kas\u0131m\u2019\u0131nda emekli oldu ve as\u0131l mesle\u011fine kesin d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f yapt\u0131. Ye\u015fil Gazete\u2019yi yemye\u015fil yapmak gibi bir g\u00f6revi kendisine misyon edinmi\u015ftir. Adanal\u0131d\u0131r, Galatasarayl\u0131d\u0131r, T\u00fcrkiye\u2019de ya\u015famaktad\u0131r ve bu \u00fc\u00e7 mucizeyi allah\u0131n kendisine bir l\u00fctfu saymaktad\u0131r.\r\nanavarrza@gmail.com","url":"https://yesilgazete.org/author/alpert/","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","@id":"https://yesilgazete.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/yesil-gazete-logo-150x150.jpg","url":"https://yesilgazete.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/yesil-gazete-logo-150x150.jpg","caption":"Alper Tolga Akku\u015f","inLanguage":"tr"},"sameAs":["http://acikradyogunlugu.wordpress.com/"]},{"@type":"BlogPosting","headline":"Yeni Siyasetin ad\u0131 kondu: Ye\u015filler ve Sol Gelecek - Ye\u015fil Gazete","datePublished":"2012-11-27T07:04:51+02:00","dateModified":"2012-12-02T20:27:31+02:00","author":{"@id":"https://yesilgazete.org/author/alpert/","name":"Alper Tolga Akku\u015f"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://yesilgazete.org/#organization"},"description":"Ye\u015filler Partisi ile E\u015fitlik ve Demokrasi Partisinin bir seneyi ge\u00e7en \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131, bu bir sene m\u00fcddetince yeni siyasete kat\u0131lanlar\u0131n yaratt\u0131\u011f\u0131 sinerji, \u00fclkenin yeni, ye\u015fil, sol ve e\u011flenceli bir siyasi harekete olan ihtiyac\u0131 25 Kas\u0131m Pazar g\u00fcn\u00fc Ankara Kocatepe K\u00fclt\u00fcr Kongresi'nde ger\u00e7ekle\u015fen kurulu\u015f kongresinde meyvesini verdi.","name":"Yeni Siyasetin ad\u0131 kondu: Ye\u015filler ve Sol Gelecek - Ye\u015fil Gazete","@id":"https://yesilgazete.org/yeni-siyasetin-adi-kondu-yesiller-ve-sol-gelecek/#richSnippet","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://yesilgazete.org/yeni-siyasetin-adi-kondu-yesiller-ve-sol-gelecek/#webpage"},"image":